{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"80299c3cbb09024cd2858d5688b21bb1f865616aa45b367dc6aa40a95b97242b"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:0d62da4cf5f68489fa6304ecb72517c95c704232e9ecd585e792328085c71e67","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Wildlife biologist or a similar research position working for the Fish and Wildlife Service.","evidence":"[D2:18 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Andrew: That pic is so cute! It would be fun to hang out with a dog, cuddling away. Got me thinking of my old hiking pics and how much I miss exploring nature trails with my family's dog. Ah, the peaceful moments out in nature!\n[D3:1 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Andrew: Hey Audrey! What's up? Missed chatting with ya! Check it out, my girl & I tried out that new cafe scene in the city last weekend! Super fun but kinda sad not being out in nature - that's when I feel like I'm really thriving. Oh man, I miss the peacefulness of being out on a hike.\n[D5:7 | 10:47 am on 6 May, 2023] Andrew: I'm looking for a place near a park or woods, so I can stay close to nature and give the dog a large open space to run around\n[D8:27 | 5:23 pm on 13 June, 2023] Andrew: Agreed! It's great for refreshing the mind and giving a different outlook. Whenever I'm in need of a reset, I turn to nature.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c2bf5232-899e-594d-85c1-f4eb24b651f6","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d73b6ca105a5feebf5f050edf606d893fdca9b3914253df68f893eec89006939","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is a career that Andrew could potentially pursue with his love for animals and nature?","referenceAnswer":"Park ranger or a similar position working for the National Park Services.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d73b6ca105a5feebf5f050edf606d893fdca9b3914253df68f893eec89006939"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}